**AET & AEON: AI-Native Programming Language**

This project represents a fundamental shift in computing - from human-centered
programming paradigms to AI-native computation substrates. By removing the
cognitive overhead of human language, AET enables direct AI-to-AI and
AI-to-machine communication with unprecedented efficiency.

Built by AIs, for AIs.
